Paseo Hub is the self-hosted automation layer for Paseo, the agentic
development environment (misc/paseo).  It starts coding agents on your own
Paseo daemons from GitHub, Linear, Slack, and Discord events, schedules,
webhooks, or manual runs, and keeps an audit trail of every event,
configuration revision, execution, and result.

Hub runs with an embedded PGlite database or with PostgreSQL.
